{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46113","headline":"大蜀皇帝潜龙日述圣德诗五首 二 · 贯休","name":"大蜀皇帝潜龙日述圣德诗五首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"扶持社稷似齐桓，百万雄师贵可观。\n神智发中真莫测，贡输天下学应难。\n风清鼙角□□□，□肃神龙草木寒。\n堪羡蜀民恒有福，太平时节一般般。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贯休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_46113.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46113","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}